- Since the current code already builds two fixed-parameter learners, treat them as two ensemble members: one LightGBM prob stream and one CatBoost prob stream.
- Do not change the preprocessing graph, the train/valid split, or the model parameters; just preserve both prediction chains and combine their outputs.
