- Keep the threshold at 0.5 for the final label, so the only change is the blend weights.
- For submission, reuse the same chosen weights on the full-train refit predictions and keep the rest of the script unchanged.
- This is Pattern A: multi-leg plus blend, with each leg’s skrub/DataOps chain intact and the ensemble done only at the prediction merge layer.
